  message: "Audit filed (2026-07-20, PR #776): docs/audits/0016-resolver-openapi-rpc-family.md. The missing per-family audit is now filed: all 4 pending_classification values FOLD, zero CANONICAL (overriding the item working hypothesis that several are likely CANONICAL, via the four-leakage-test pass). resolver_implements / openapi_implements / implements_rpc fold to implements + meta[protocol]; resolver_for_type folds to references. Two migration caveats recorded: openapi_implements emits contract-to-handler (inverse of implements; needs a producer direction flip, or fold to references direction-preservingly); implements_rpc is traceable/taint-coupled (taint.py:1120, io_boundary.py:1146/1649, ranking.py:203 weight 1.0) so a naive rename would silently demote gRPC reachability/taint. The audit deliverable is complete; the 4 FOLD producer migrations remain follow-on (bundle with WI-pumav batching or file per-value)."  # 50bd
